    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[261]'
      value: If you see [][][][][] on chinese or  special languages, do the following...
        /Search  for "TMP Settings"on your browser /Add  NatoSansKR,NatoSansMyanr,NatoSansTC
        and NatoSansThai to the "FallBack Font Assets" on "TMP Settings.
