    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[651]'
      value: " 5. Each spin has a maximum payout      ratio of 10,000 times. When
        this     ratio is reached, the continuous      matching for prize will stop,
        and     the reward settlement will      proceed. 6. Malfunction voids all
        pays and      plays. If any malfunction occurs     during the feature game,
        the      system will  automatically      complete the game and ensure     
        the player receives their      winnings. Where an interruption      occurs
        after the operator      receives notification of the      customer\xB4s gamble
        and where      the customer can have no further       influence on the outcome
        of the      event or gamble the results of the      gamble should  stand.A
        game      round is immediately ended when      the win cap is reached, and     
        all winnings will be paid out.      Maximum Payout : 10,000,000      Maximum
        Win Odds : 10,000x      Minimum bet : 0.5     Maximum bet : \u200E1,000"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[652]'
