    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[658]'
      value: " 5. Setiap putaran memiliki pembayaran maksimum      rasio 10.000 kali.
        Saat ini     rasio tercapai, terus menerus      pencocokan hadiah akan berhenti,
        dan     penyelesaian hadiah akan terjadi      melanjutkan. 6. Kerusakan membatalkan
        semua pembayaran dan      diputar. Jika terjadi malfungsi     selama permainan
        fitur, itu      sistem akan secara otomatis      selesaikan permainan dan
        pastikan      pemain menerima miliknya      kemenangan. Dimana ada gangguan     
        terjadi setelah operator      menerima pemberitahuan tentang      pertaruhan
        pelanggan dan di mana      pelanggan tidak dapat melanjutkan       mempengaruhi
        hasil dari      acara atau mempertaruhkan hasil      pertaruhan harus bertahan.
        Sebuah permainan      putaran segera berakhir ketika      batas kemenangan
        tercapai, dan      semua kemenangan akan dibayarkan.      Pembayaran Maksimum
        : 10.000.000      Peluang Kemenangan Maksimum : 10.000x      Taruhan minimum
        : 0,5     Taruhan maksimum : \u200E1.000"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[659]'
      value: " 5. M\u1ED7i v\xF2ng quay c\xF3 m\u1EE9c thanh to\xE1n t\u1ED1i \u0111a     
        t\u1EF7 l\u1EC7 10.000 l\u1EA7n. Khi \u0111i\u1EC1u n\xE0y     \u0111\u1EA1t
        \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EF7 l\u1EC7, li\xEAn t\u1EE5c      vi\u1EC7c kh\u1EDBp
        gi\u1EA3i th\u01B0\u1EDFng s\u1EBD d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i, v\xE0     vi\u1EC7c
        gi\u1EA3i quy\u1EBFt ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng s\u1EBD      ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c.
        6. S\u1EF1 c\u1ED1 l\xE0m m\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7u l\u1EF1c t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 c\xE1c
        kho\u1EA3n thanh to\xE1n v\xE0      v\u1EDF k\u1ECBch. N\u1EBFu c\xF3 s\u1EF1
        c\u1ED1 x\u1EA3y ra     trong tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i t\xEDnh n\u0103ng,      h\u1EC7
        th\u1ED1ng s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng      ho\xE0n th\xE0nh tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i
        v\xE0 \u0111\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
        c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD      ti\u1EC1n th\u1EAFng c\u01B0\u1EE3c. N\u01A1i b\u1ECB
        gi\xE1n \u0111o\u1EA1n      x\u1EA3y ra sau to\xE1n t\u1EED      nh\u1EADn
        \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\xF4ng b\xE1o c\u1EE7a      canh b\u1EA1c c\u1EE7a
        kh\xE1ch h\xE0ng v\xE0 \u1EDF \u0111\xE2u      kh\xE1ch h\xE0ng kh\xF4ng
        th\u1EC3 c\xF3 th\xEAm       \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng \u0111\u1EBFn k\u1EBFt
        qu\u1EA3 c\u1EE7a      s\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n ho\u1EB7c \u0111\xE1nh b\u1EA1c
        k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 c\u1EE7a      canh b\u1EA1c n\xEAn \u0111\u1EE9ng. M\u1ED9t
        tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i      v\xF2ng \u0111\u1EA5u k\u1EBFt th\xFAc ngay l\u1EADp
        t\u1EE9c khi      \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n
        chi\u1EBFn th\u1EAFng v\xE0      t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 ti\u1EC1n th\u1EAFng c\u01B0\u1EE3c
        s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c thanh to\xE1n.      Kho\u1EA3n thanh to\xE1n
        t\u1ED1i \u0111a : 10.000.000      T\u1EF7 l\u1EC7 th\u1EAFng t\u1ED1i \u0111a:
        10.000 l\u1EA7n      \u0110\u1EB7t c\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1ED1i thi\u1EC3u: 0,5    
        \u0110\u1EB7t c\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1ED1i \u0111a: 1.000"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[660]'
      value: " 5. Cada rodada tem um pagamento m\xE1ximo      propor\xE7\xE3o de
        10.000 vezes. Quando isso     propor\xE7\xE3o \xE9 alcan\xE7ada, o cont\xEDnuo     
        a correspond\xEAncia pelo pr\xEAmio ser\xE1 interrompida e     a liquida\xE7\xE3o
        da recompensa ser\xE1      prossiga. 6. O mau funcionamento anula todos os
        pagamentos e      joga. Se ocorrer algum mau funcionamento     durante o
        jogo paralelo, o      sistema ir\xE1 automaticamente      complete o jogo
        e garanta      o jogador recebe seu      ganhos. Onde uma interrup\xE7\xE3o     
        ocorre ap\xF3s o operador      recebe notifica\xE7\xE3o do      aposta do
        cliente e onde      o cliente n\xE3o pode ter mais       influ\xEAncia no
        resultado do      evento ou apostar os resultados do      a aposta deve permanecer.
        Um jogo      a rodada termina imediatamente quando      o limite de ganhos
        \xE9 atingido e      todos os ganhos ser\xE3o pagos.      Pagamento m\xE1ximo:
        10.000.000      Probabilidades m\xE1ximas de vit\xF3ria: 10.000x      Aposta
        m\xEDnima: 0,5     Aposta m\xE1xima: 1.000"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
