    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[1178]'
      value: Setelah pocker emas Menang, itu akan berubah menjadi liar di tempat
        yang sama
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[1179]'
      value: "Sau khi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i v\xE0ng th\u1EAFng, n\xF3 s\u1EBD
        tr\u1EDF n\xEAn hoang d\xE3 \u1EDF c\xF9ng m\u1ED9t n\u01A1i"
